WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:11.450
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.476
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.588
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.221
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.852
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:43.039
Kyou kasho...seifuku...
mada kami, kawakanai...

00:00:44.383 --> 00:00:49.844
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.621
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.329
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:08.870
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:15.612
Amakute nigai. . .marmalade

00:01:15.747 --> 00:01:18.181
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.717 --> 00:01:20.742
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.983
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.984
Aitsu no egao ni aitai!

00:02:35.961 --> 00:02:43.766
HALF BROTHER AND SISTER —
"OUR HAPPINESS
IS SHATTERING."

00:12:14.072 --> 00:12:16.199
MARMALADE BOY

00:12:22.814 --> 00:12:25.442
MARMALADE BOY

00:14:54.799 --> 00:14:55.993
YEARBOOK

00:14:56.134 --> 00:14:57.726
SOUJITSU UNIVERSITY

00:16:02.333 --> 00:16:04.563
TO YOUJI MATSUURA

00:20:24.929 --> 00:20:26.863
PARK

00:22:11.335 --> 00:22:12.302
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.791 --> 00:22:36.225
FAREWELL —
"I HAD NO CHOICE."

00:22:53.844 --> 00:22:58.372
Kokoro ga arawareru

00:22:58.515 --> 00:23:03.714
Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:23:03.888 --> 00:23:08.484
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:08.626 --> 00:23:14.064
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:14.231 --> 00:23:19.134
Donna ni tooku

00:23:19.303 --> 00:23:24.240
Hanarete ite mo

00:23:24.408 --> 00:23:29.277
Onnaji yoake wo

00:23:29.413 --> 00:23:34.783
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:34.919 --> 00:23:39.549
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:44.992
Omoide wo musubu ito

00:23:45.129 --> 00:23:50.192
Mirai no mirai ni mo

00:23:50.334 --> 00:23:55.362
Kamisama ga itekureru

00:23:55.506 --> 00:24:01.775
Kamisama ga itekureru
